cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use rmw_qnx or its evaluation, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "rmw_qnx: ROS 2 over QNX message passing, so a node's priority travels with its messages"
abstract: >-
  A ROS 2 Jazzy middleware (RMW) implementation for QNX SDP 8.0. Service requests travel by MsgSend and MsgReply,
  so the server's callback runs at the calling client's priority; topics are shared-memory rings woken by pulses at
  each subscriber's own priority; the graph is browsable under /dev/ros2 through a QNX resource manager.
authors:
  - family-names: Donovici
    given-names: Marc
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Marc-Dvci/rmw_qnx"
keywords:
  - ROS 2
  - QNX
  - RMW
  - real-time
  - priority inheritance
  - message passing
